      <activity id="743ba26c-70b3-585e-9de8-d555aeb8603b" activityNameId="e29f4424-e688-51dd-aa82-2eadd25bb0d1" activityNameContextId="f44c43c1-5cc5-54a6-ade6-24435bd12c83" type="1" specialActivityType="0" energyValues="0">
        <activityName xml:lang="en">Facilities blister-copper conversion, secondary copper</activityName>
        <generalComment>
          <text xml:lang="en" index="1">Full activity name: Facilities blister-copper conversion, secondary copper
Production of Kaldo converter and converter aisle: chromium steel, refractory bricks and concrete foundation. Building hall houses the facilities, covering 1200m2. Service lifetime 50 year. Service lifetime 50 year, 250'000 t of metals produced per year.;
Synonyms: Kaldo Converter; 
UUID: e1474a23-16a6-31c1-8fc5-6e132ba57f20
Construction of facilities and housing, and their disposal. No transports and construction work considered.
Location: Data describes a Swedish plant that is singular in the region and ranges worldwide among the big producer. It may be taken as approximation for the global situation
Technology: Due to high temperature chromium steel and refractory materials are used. Kaldo converter and converter aisle considered.
Time period: undefined
Production volume: na
Sampling: estimation 
Extrapolations: see Geography and Technology
Uncertainty adjustments: see Geography and Technology
BAFU mapped export: unsupported biosphere exchanges excluded; see audit/. Local UUIDs and generic activity classification are export conventions. Source: process_e1474a23-16a6-31c1-8fc5-6e132ba57f20.xml</text>
        </generalComment>
      </activity>
